:"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109784.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"When `class_name` isn't an option for gdscript classes for your project for any reason. This change list unnamed scripts within the base type's class hierarchy to create dialogs.\r\n\r\nCloses: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8102\r\nHere's an example of what the create-dialogs will look like listing unnamed scripts. \r\nFirst screenshot includes script that extend an engine class that extends one of the Resource class.\r\nSecond screenshot includes scripts that directly inherit the Resource or another script that is part of that hierarchy.\r\n<img width=\"626\" height=\"204\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12d95d76-da91-4544-b34c-275aaff62cfc\" />\r\n<img width=\"810\" height=\"284\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c5a92d7-1541-439a-a679-77f7b80524a4\" />\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109784/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109784/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}